[
  {
    "entryID": 1,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（前廳今天很擠。赤龍幫的旗子插在門外，來了十幾個人，個個腰上有傢伙。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      2
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 2,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（上座那個白髮老頭袒著胸膛，一隻腳踩在凳子上，正在跟賈詡談事。桌上攤著帳。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      3
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 3,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「……這幾條老子都認了。錢照給，不囉嗦。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      4
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 4,
    "actorID": "MC4",
    "text": "「幫主爽快。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC4,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      5
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 5,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（帳收起來了。賈詡起身，作了個送客的手勢。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      6
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 6,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（那老頭沒動。他往院子那邊看了一眼。呂信正扛著那柄門板從演武場走出來，滿頭大汗。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      7
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 7,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「那柄刀，幾斤？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      8
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 8,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「沒秤過。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      9
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 9,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（老頭看著他把刀從肩上卸下來。一隻手。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      10
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 10,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哈。扛得動這東西的，老子那三百人裡挑不出三個。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC10,Proud);",
    "links": [
      11
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 11,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他轉回頭，對著賈詡。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);",
    "links": [
      12
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 12,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「這小子，借老子使使。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      13
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 13,
    "actorID": "MC4",
    "text": "[panel=2]「幫主說笑了。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC4,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      14
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 14,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「老子不說笑。你開個價。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      15
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 15,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「……欸？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Shock);",
    "links": [
      16
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 16,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信走進來了。他把刀往地上一戳，看著那個老頭。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);",
    "links": [
      17
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 17,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「褚幫主，你這是在買人？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      18
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 18,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哈哈哈！好！老子就喜歡這種不怕死的！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC10,Proud);",
    "links": [
      19
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 19,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「不是買。老子在請。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      20
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 20,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他伸出三根手指。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      21
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 21,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「一、雁門城西那片地，連鋪子帶宅子，過到你名下。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      22
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 22,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「二、老子手底下三百人，你點名要誰就帶誰走。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      23
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 23,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「三、」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      24
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 24,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他把那三根手指收成拳頭。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      25
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 25,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「老子這條命賭一把大的。你要是肯來，賭贏了，你就是開國的那一批。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC10,Proud);",
    "links": [
      26
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 26,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「劉邦當年也不過是個亭長。老子為何不能成皇？」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      27
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 27,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（前廳裡沒有人說話。賈詡在旁邊喝茶，一句都沒有接。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC4,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      28
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 28,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（三根手指。三百人，城西一片地。府裡那本帳你見過，今年連三萬六的窟窿都還填不上。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=13);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Nervous_2);",
    "links": [
      29
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 29,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信沒有立刻回答。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=12);",
    "links": [
      30
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 30,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「先別答。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      31
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 31,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「那刀，使一趟老子看看。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      32
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 32,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信看了他一眼，把刀從地上拔起來，走到前廳中間。桌椅被幾個赤龍幫的人往牆邊拖。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      33
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 33,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（老頭的眼睛轉過來，落在你身上。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      34
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 34,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「你。陪他走一趟。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      35,
      36
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 35,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "[em2][武藝檢定][/em2]「來。」",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項1：武藝檢定（下場陪他走一趟）",
    "links": [
      37
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 36,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "（站著看）",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Description": "選項2：不下場",
    "links": [
      45
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 37,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);SetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);Continue()@Message(EndRoll);BeginDiceRoll(Manual,MartialArtsCheck,12);",
    "Description": "選項1的空對話擲骰節點：武藝檢定 難度12",
    "links": [
      38
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 38,
    "actorID": "MC1",
    "text": "「來。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=8);",
    "links": [
      39,
      42
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 39,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你接住了第一刀，也接住了第二刀。第三刀他沒有收力，你飛出去撞在門框上。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,MartialArts,10);SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == true;",
    "links": [
      40
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 40,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哈哈哈！好！兩個都好！」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC10,Proud);",
    "links": [
      41
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 41,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信把刀收了。收得比出刀快。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      47
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 42,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（一刀。你的刀飛了，人在地上。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=11);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Pain);",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      43
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 43,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哈。」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      44
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 44,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信把你拉起來，沒說話。他把刀收了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      47
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 45,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（你沒有動。呂信自己走了一趟——三刀，刀刀帶風，把牆邊那幾個赤龍幫的人逼得往後縮。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      451
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 451,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哈哈哈！好刀！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC10,Proud);",
    "links": [
      46
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 46,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信把刀收了，走回來，站在你旁邊。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      47
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 47,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「怎麼樣，小子。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      48
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 48,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信沒有立刻回答。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      49
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 49,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);SetContinueMode(original)@Message(EndRoll);Continue()@Message(EndRoll);BeginDiceRoll(Auto,InsightCheck,10);",
    "Description": "自動洞悉檢定觸發點：難度10",
    "links": [
      50
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 50,
