    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "Continue();",
    "Description": "空內容緩衝節點，用於連接檢定結果",
    "links": [
      51,
      56
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 51,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（三息。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == true;",
    "links": [
      52
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 52,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他聽完半句話就出門殺人的時候，沒有三息。他一眼掃過去就決定出不出手的時候，也沒有。）＊",
    "Sequence": "ModifyData(FeatExp,Player,Insight,10);",
    "links": [
      53
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 53,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（這三息裡，他的眼睛動了。從那老頭的手，到院子，到堂上那塊「英豪府」的匾，再回到那老頭的手。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC1,pic=4);EnableCharacterExpression(0,MC1-1,Shock);",
    "links": [
      54
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 54,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(0);Continue();",
    "Description": "空內容緩衝節點，關閉表情特效",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 56,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他頓了一下，然後就答了。前廳裡連茶碗的聲音都沒有。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "Conditions": "IsPassDice() == false;",
    "links": [
      60
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 60,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「褚幫主。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      61
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 61,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「你這三樣，我一樣都要不起。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      62
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 62,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哦？」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=4);",
    "links": [
      63
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 63,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「地我守不住，人我養不活，至於那第三樣——」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      64
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 64,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「你賭你的。我這人不賭。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC2,Proud);",
    "links": [
      65
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 65,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（褚人飛盯著他看了一會，然後大笑起來，笑得整個前廳都在響。）＊",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);EnableCharacterExpression(1,MC10,Proud);",
    "links": [
      66
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 66,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「哈哈哈哈！好！有種！」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=5);",
    "links": [
      67
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 67,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「老子最恨人跟我講價，講價的都是狗。你不講價，你直接不要——」",
    "Sequence": "DisableCharacterExpression(1);SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      68
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 68,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「痛快。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      69
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 69,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他站起來，拍了拍衣襬，往門口走。走到門邊，他忽然回過頭。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      70
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 70,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「小子。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      71
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 71,
    "actorID": "MC10",
    "text": "「老子這扇門，不關。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC10,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      72
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 72,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（人走了。旗子撤了。前廳一下子空得很。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      73
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 73,
    "actorID": "MC4",
    "text": "[panel=2]「呂信。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC4,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      74
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 74,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「師父。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      75
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 75,
    "actorID": "MC4",
    "text": "[panel=2]「今年的餉，還是發不出來。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC4,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      76
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 76,
    "actorID": "MC2",
    "text": "[panel=1]「知道。」",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      77
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 77,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（賈詡點了個頭，收起帳本走了。從頭到尾，他一句挽留的話都沒有說。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      80
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 80,
    "actorID": "0",
    "text": "",
    "Sequence": "SetContinueMode(false);PlayFeelFeedback(FadeInOut,1,0.5,1,#000000,1);SetContinueMode(original)@2.5;Continue()@2.5;",
    "Description": "轉場節點：入夜（同一景，只淡出淡入）",
    "links": [
      81
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 81,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（那天夜裡前廳沒點燈。你進去的時候，上座有人。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      82
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 82,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（呂信坐在白天那老頭坐的凳子上，一隻腳踩在凳沿，跟那老頭一樣。腳邊兩罈酒。）＊",
    "Sequence": "SetPortrait(MC2,pic=1);",
    "links": [
      83
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 83,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（他沒有提白天的事。他講了很多別的——雁門的酒比雲中的烈、城西那片地他小時候路過過、赤龍幫那三百人裡有幾個他認得。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      84
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 84,
    "actorID": "2",
    "text": "[panel=6]＊（講到後來，他不講了。腳也放下來了。）＊",
    "Sequence": "",
    "links": [
      85
    ]
  },
  {
    "entryID": 85,
    "actorID": "2",
